{
  "file_id": "3591",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 62,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Ah! Sora, look!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8616,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Ah! Sora, ¡mira!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "There's a Yokomon. Why's it in\nsuch a hurry?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8632,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Hay un Yokomon. ¿Por qué\ntanta prisa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Piyomon! Sora! Help!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8678,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Piyomon! ¡Sora! ¡Ayuda!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Calm down and tell us what\nhappened.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8699,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Cálmate y cuéntanos qué\npasó."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Hurry, hurry!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8736,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Rápido, ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Hurry, hurry!",
      "speaker_id": 9901,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8750,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Rápido, ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "It left without saying anything.",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8764,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Se fue sin decir nada."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Let's go to the Yokomon village!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8797,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Vamos a la aldea Yokomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Sora! Piyomon! Over here!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8831,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Sora! ¡Piyomon! ¡Aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "What in the world is going on?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8857,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Qué diablos está pasando?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Some Yokomon left the village to\nlook for DigiStrawberries, and\nthey haven't come back!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8888,
      "_bytes": 88,
      "translation": "¡Unos Yokomon salieron a\nbuscar DigiFresas, y no han\nvuelto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I know where to find\nDigiStrawberries! Why don't we go\nlook for them together, Sora?",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8977,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "¡Sé dónde encontrar\nDigiFresas! ¿Vamos a\nbuscarlas juntas, Sora?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Of course! How many Yokomon are\nmissing?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9062,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Claro! ¿Cuántos Yokomon\nfaltan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Um...1, 2, 3, 4, 5! Five total.",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9104,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Eh...¡1,2,3,4,5! Cinco en total."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Got it! All right, let's look for\nthem!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9136,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Entendido! ¡Vale, vamos a\nbuscarlos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Sora, this is where you gather\nDigiStrawberries!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9176,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Sora, ¡aquí es donde se\nrecogen las DigiFresas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Hey! Something's buried here!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9225,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Eh! ¡Hay algo enterrado aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Heave-ho!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9255,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Aúpa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "*yawn* That was a good nap...",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9265,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "(bostezo) Menuda siesta..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Whoa! It was sleeping in the\nmiddle of the desert!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9295,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Vaya! ¡Estaba durmiendo en\nmedio del desierto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "How'd you manage to sleep in this\nhot sand?",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9346,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¿Cómo dormiste en esta arena\ntan caliente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "I must've fallen asleep! Thank\nyou, Sora, Piyomon!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9390,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Debí quedarme dormido!\n¡Gracias, Sora, Piyomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "We have to hurry and find the\nrest!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9441,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Hay que buscar al resto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Here! One left!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9477,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Aquí! ¡Queda uno!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "But there aren't any\nDigiStrawberries beyond this\npoint.",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9493,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "Pero no hay DigiFresas\nmás allá de este punto."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "No way. But we've only found\nfour...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9550,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "No puede ser. Solo hay\ncuatro..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "But if we go past this hill, we'll\nget lost, too!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9587,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Pero si pasamos esta\ncolina, nos perdemos\ntambién!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 9637,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "The last one must have already\nreturned. Let's go back there\ntogether.",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9641,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "El último ya debe de haber\nvuelto. Volvamos juntas."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "We're back!",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9712,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Ya volvimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Hey, while we were looking for the\nlost Yokomon, did anyone come\nback?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9724,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Oye, mientras buscábamos a\nlos Yokomon perdidos, ¿volvió\nalguien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Nope! No one did.",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9796,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡No! Nadie volvió."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Oh, no! We have to go back to the\ndesert!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9814,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Oh, no! ¡Hay que volver al\ndesierto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Sora, behind you!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9856,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "Sora, ¡detrás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Ack! There's... another Piyomon?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9874,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¿Hay... otro Piyomon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "A rampagin' Piyomon?!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9907,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡¿Un Piyomon furioso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "It's a different Piyomon. Guys,\nkeep it together! Let's fight!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9929,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Es un Piyomon distinto.\nChicos, ¡mantened la calma!\n¡A luchar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "The Piyomon's shrinking!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9992,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡El Piyomon encoge!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It must have exhausted its energy.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10017,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Se habrá quedado sin energía."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I'm glad no one was hurt!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10052,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Menos mal que nadie\nsalió herido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Thanks, Sora and Piyomon!\nWe'll give you this village's\nancient treasure!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10078,
      "_bytes": 73,
      "translation": "¡Gracias, Sora y Piyomon!\n¡Os daremos el tesoro\nantiguo de la aldea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Wow! Thank you!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10152,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Vaya! ¡Gracias!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It's our thanks for saving us!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10168,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡Es nuestro agradecimiento!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I'm sorry! I ate a DigiTomato, and\nit made me start rampaging\neverywhere...",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10199,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "¡Lo siento! Comí un\nDigiTomate y empecé a\narrasar con todo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "We'll put a sign up to warn\neveryone about those DigiTomatoes!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10275,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "¡Pondremos un cartel para\navisar sobre esos\nDigiTomates!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Looks like there are four left.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10338,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Parece que quedan cuatro."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "You're doing well, Sora.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10370,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Lo haces bien, Sora."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "There's one here, too! Three left!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10395,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Hay uno aquí también! ¡Quedan tres!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Good job, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10430,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Buen trabajo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Ah, it's over here! Two left!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10446,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Ah, está aquí! ¡Quedan dos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Keep at it, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10476,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Sigue así, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "How many Yokomon do we still need\nto find?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10494,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¿Cuántos Yokomon nos quedan\npor encontrar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Uh... there are five left. Keep at\nit!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10538,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "Eh... quedan cinco. ¡Sigue\nasí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Uh... there are four left. Keep at\nit!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10577,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "Eh... quedan cuatro. ¡Sigue\nasí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Uh... there are three left. Keep\nat it!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10616,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Eh... quedan tres. ¡Sigue\nasí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Uh... there are two left. Keep at\nit!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10656,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Eh... quedan dos. ¡Sigue\nasí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "When they get back, all the lost\nYokomon should go home and get\nsome rest.",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10694,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Cuando vuelvan, todos los\nYokomon perdidos deberían\nir a descansar a casa."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "They must be tired and thirsty.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10770,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Estarán cansados y con sed."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "We'll bring some tasty water from\nOutlook Mountain later!",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10802,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "¡Luego traeremos agua rica\nde la Montaña Panorámica!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "We Yokomon and Meramon have been\ndoing fine since that incident.",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10860,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Los Yokomon y Meramon\nestamos bien desde\naquel incidente."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "But right now, I'm more worried\nabout the Yokomon who haven't\nreturned...",
      "speaker_id": 2311,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10926,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "Pero ahora me preocupan más\nlos Yokomon que no han\nvuelto..."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "We'll find them as soon as we can.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11001,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Los encontraremos ya mismo."
    }
  ]
}